    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76803" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλαί-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαιόομαι</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>keeping for a long
			time</i>, esp. of wine, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαίωσιν δέχεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					5.4.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.656b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.33b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Xenocr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2.58.140
			</span></i>; of drugs, <i>maturing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Decent.</u>
				10
			</span></i>; <i>dilapidated condition</i> of a house, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stud.Pal.</u>
				22.131.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διελθεῖν εἰς π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Na.</u>
					1.15
				</span></i>
			(<i><span class="en">
				2.1
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆνις ὀργὴ εἰς π.
			ἀποτιθεμένη</span> Andronic.Rhod.<i><span class="en">
				p.572
			</span></i> M.</div>
